      "ConcreteType": "Dynamo.Graph.Nodes.CodeBlockNodeModel, DynamoCore",
      "NodeType": "CodeBlockNode",
      "Code": "pX = Point.X(pointIN);\npY = Point.Y(pointIN);\npZ = Point.Z(pointIN);\ngeom = elemLocation;\ngeomX = Point.X(geom);\ngeomY = Point.Y(geom);\ngeomZ = Point.Z(geom);\ngeomBB = BoundingBox.ByGeometry(elemGeometry);\ngeomMIN = BoundingBox.MinPoint(geomBB);\ngeomMAX = BoundingBox.MaxPoint(geomBB);\ngeomLINE = Line.ByStartPointEndPoint(geomMIN, geomMAX);\ngeomMID = Curve.PointAtParameter(geomLINE, 0.5);\ngeomMIDX = Point.X(geomMID);\ngeomMIDY = Point.Y(geomMID);\nmoveX = pX + geomX - geomMIDX;\nmoveY = pY + geomY - geomMIDY;\nmoveZ = pZ + geomZ;\npointMOVE = Point.ByCoordinates(moveX, moveY, moveZ);",
